   <refbody>    <section>
      <p>This API request includes the following path and header parameters.</p>
      <ul id="ul_104927103">
         <li>Path Parameters:</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The path parameters of the request URL path act as a placeholder for the motor ID value.</p>
    </section>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
         <tgroup cols="4">
            <colspec colname="c1"/>
            <colspec colname="c2"/>
            <colspec colname="c3"/>
            <colspec colname="c4"/>
            <tbody>
               <row>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Parameter</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Type</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Description</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Required</b>
                  </entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>motorId</entry>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>Unique identifier for this motor. The unique motor ID assigned to a motor can be found in the get all motors response.</entry>
                  <entry>Yes</entry>
               </row>
            </tbody>
         </tgroup>
      </table>
    <section>
      <ul id="ul_104927104">
         <li>Header Parameters:</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The header parameters provide instructions to the API on handling the request such as authentication.</p>
    </section>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
         <tgroup cols="5">
            <colspec colname="c1"/>
