            <colspec colname="c5"/>
            <tbody>
               <row>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Parameter</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Type</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Description</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Input Value</b>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                     <b>Required</b>
                  </entry>
               </row>
               <row>
                  <entry>Authorization</entry>
                  <entry>string</entry>
                  <entry>Authenticates API requests. Provide a valid bearer token in the HTTP header.  This bearer token can be obtained from the <xref href="../access_the_api/oauth.dita" format="dita">OAuth bearer token request</xref>.</entry>
                  <entry>N/A</entry>
                  <entry>Yes</entry>
               </row>
            </tbody>
